{
  "name": "TL_net trains SONAM EA faculty on Moodle Course Design",
  "parent_id": 203313866751254,
  "group_id": "d7c90eb8-c7c5-4447-8cd8-d2e8f0d0323f",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-30T15:16:15.843Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-30T15:16:15.925Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-30T15:16:15.911Z",
  "id": 203714461090341,
  "uuid": "8a157d8e-09ce-4b9d-95dd-52374a2a6b9c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "64b41b89-040c-627f-4314-0588ea12140b",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "1ca9a5c5-b56d-bb5e-38eb-6a8f05a2fdbb",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The aim of the training workshop was to enhance faculty members' capacity to integrate use of technology in teaching and learning -in this case, building a course space on the Moodle virtual learning environment.  The training focused on:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Assisting faculty members to develop one course on the Moodle platform.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Uploading documents into the course site including the course outline",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Navigating  Moodle with ease",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "TL_net followed up the training with student orientation sessions for each SONAM-EA location that showed students how to access and use their Moodle courses. Over 142 students participated in the session from Kenya Uganda and Tanzania.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The faculty members appreciated the training and when asked whether the workshop increased their confidence to teach using the Moodle platform, this is what one had to say:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Absolutely! My course material is more organised and I feel this will impact positively on students\".",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "On what they liked most, one participant had the following to say:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"The hands on approach was excellent!\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "When asked what they would like to see next, a number of faculty pointed out the need to bring on board students and new faculty:",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Students being prepared and taught on Moodle should be the next step as well as include this workshop as part of orientation for new faculty and part-timers.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "TL_net will continue to engage in such initiatives that will support faculty to teach with technology.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
